$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Synthesis of 19a and 19b by oxidation of 18a
and 18b When the compounds 18a, 18b were treated with H2O 2 in THF
solution at rt, the amidates 19a, 19b were formed after 1 h.
5,7-Di-tert-butyl-2-(dimethylamino)benzo[d][1,2]oxaphosphone-3(2H)-oxime
(19a, C17H27N2O3P) Yellow crystals; yield: 811 mg (75 %). m.p.: 223 °C
(EtOH); IR (KBr): ν = 3,337 (NOH), 1,256 (P═O), 1,328, 855 (P-NMe2) cm-1;
1H NMR (500.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ = 1.25, 1.37 [2 s, 2 × 9H, 2(Me3C)], 3.11
(d, 3JP-H = 10.4 Hz, 6H, Me2N-P), 6.41 (d, JH-H = 4.2 Hz, 1H, H(4)-Ar),
6.99 (d, JH-H = 4.2 Hz, 1H, H(6)-Ar), 10.40 (br s, 1H, HON) ppm; 31P NMR
(200.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ = 12.7 ppm; MS (EI, 70 eV): m/z (%) = 338 (21)
[M+], 337 (44) [M+ -1], 307 (23) [M+ -31, NOH], 77 (86).
