$DATUM 1,12-Bis[di(p-tolyl)phosphinoyl]-2,11-dibutyl-2,11-diaza-5,8-dioxadodecane
(VII). a. A mixture of 2.76 g of di(p-tolyl)phosphinous acid, 0.36 g of
Paraform, and 1.56 of compound XII was refluxed in benzene with a
Dean-Stark trap for 40 min. Over this period, about 95% of water was
collected. After that the mixture was refluxed for an additional 40 min
and then evaporated to constant weight. The residual viscous liquid was
purified by column chromatography to obtain compound. Light yellow
viscous liquid, yield 3.3 g (74%). Rf: 0.45; IR spectrum, ν(P=O), cm-1:
1190; δ , ppm: 24.7; Found, %: C 73.74, H 9.21, P 6.66; Calculated, %: C
73.74, H 8.76, P 6.96; Formula: C44H62N2O4P2.
